  abilityDescription: "Airborne tank. Immune to acid rain and pools. Attacks operators with pink arts bolts. Periodically halts to summon 2 Oculite Spawns sequentially (with a 10% chance each for an additional Oculite, an Oculoid Carrier, or an Occuworm). Spawns 2 Oculites upon defeat."
  intelQuote: "*low droning hum from above*"
  intelLore: "Occu Flying Object — a hovering bio-mechanical vessel that scours the surface, seeding sludge-dwelling horrors from the air."

